Intro:
Preamble:
This guide is currently in the beta testing phase, this just means the mods run but haven’t been tested for any bugs or strange interactions/crashes that would happen later into a playthrough.

This guide will run through how to install Estrus Unified and its prerequisites as well as Ovibody and Curse of Life (optional), and is intended for those of you that also have an oviposition kink. I’ve tried to make this as beginner friendly as possible and it should be a pretty quick install process (~10 mods needed).
Compatibility:
This set of mods is incompatible with Thoshy’s UBE guide. The optional Fertility mode in Nefaram might be compatible but you will get overlapping pregnancies if you use both Fertility mode and Curse of Life, so I don’t recommend using both mods.
This mod set does work with Vokriinator Black as that is what I run it with as well as the preset compendium mods.

Install:
Part 1 - Setup:
Create the separators Estrus Requirements and Estrus and place them between AI Voices and Late Loaders. The [NoDelete] is optional 

Next create an empty mod (right click in MO2 and select create empty mod) for your own bodyslide outputs and place it below Nefarams bodyslide output in the overwrites separator. 
We do this so we don’t accidentally break the Nefaram bodyslide outputs.
