Part 3 - Bodyslide Building & Pandora:
Once you’ve installed the above mods you’ll need to build the ovibody in bodyslide if you know how to build bodyslides just build the two ovibody bodyslides to zeroed. For the first time users open bodyslide in MO2 (drop down under the regular launcher). If you need a reference image for bodyslide locations check the guide post. 
In the top right under filter outfits type in ovi.
Next select one of the ovibody’s in the top left outfit/body selection. Then select zeroes sliders just below that.
Then ctrl + click batch build and build it in the bodyslide empty mod you created in part 1.

You’ll next need to run Pandora Behaviour Engine+ and select the optional summon snap at the top. If you haven’t done this before you’ll find it in the same menu as bodyslide in MO2, just open the app, tick the optional snap animation at the top and click the run button on the right hand side. It should only take a few seconds to run, then just close it.
